  "repo_truth": "The 52-entry manifest is the complete current P3 subject. Its scoped diff is against baseline HEAD 8c16a90657a787e95d55c856fac3d8d45d9e68be. Recorded command results are: handbook-pipeline library 26 passed; pipeline capture 44 passed; pipeline handoff 9 passed; compiler capture 39 passed; compiler handoff 8 passed; pipeline compile 20 passed; compiler compile 20 passed; CLI handoff refusals 4 passed; CLI feature-spec contract 1 passed; clippy for handbook-pipeline, handbook-compiler, and handbook-cli with all targets and -D warnings exited 0; cargo fmt --all -- --check exited 0; git diff --check exited 0. These results are evidence to replay or inspect, not a parent verdict.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Read-only replay of all 52 manifest entries and the P3 scoped diff from baseline HEAD 8c16a90657a787e95d55c856fac3d8d45d9e68be.",
    "Independently verify repository-selected Work Specification descriptor resolution before mutation, duplicate-safe YAML parse, exact eight-field intake, Complete normalized content, and deterministic canonical YAML.",
    "Independently verify that artifacts/feature_spec/FEATURE_SPEC.md is only a deterministic review view and is never capture, provenance, feature-identity, fingerprint, or handoff authority.",
    "Independently verify that provenance, handoff copy/fingerprint, and feature identity bind the canonical YAML while public provenance fields/schema/API, route-basis semantics, command/stage selectors, and ExternalManualDerived trust remain unchanged.",
    "Inspect the exact positive, negative, stale-provenance, missing/incorrect descriptor, malformed/duplicate/unknown/schema-invalid YAML, and view-tamper proofs.",
    "Assess exact selector compliance, sibling-seam preservation, proof accuracy, and whether any runtime path bypasses the target boundary.",
    "Identify findings independently before comparing P3/P4 candidates with 09."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No edits, formatting, staging, commit, push, handoff, ledger, dispatch, or delegation.",
    "No engine runtime or released-definition edit, root-profile default, generic renderer engine, dynamic filename, lifecycle, Projection, overlay, migration, compatibility fallback, public handoff schema/API change, trust promotion, route-basis change, P1/P2/P4/P5/P6/P7 work, or sibling-slice work.",
    "Do not rely on any implementation-agent or parent conclusion; establish findings independently."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Verify complete subject identity and inspect the P3 scoped diff against the declared baseline.",
    "Trace the complete Stage 10 capture, provenance, feature-identity, and handoff call paths through the canonical Work Specification YAML and generated Markdown view.",
    "Replay the smallest sufficient positive and negative commands and inspect the remaining recorded command evidence.",
    "Validate exact descriptor selection, schema/intake enforcement, canonicalization, view determinism, public-contract preservation, and fail-closed behavior.",
    "Validate proof-document accuracy and ensure the subject does not promote a seam beyond its real path.",
    "Return findings first in Critical, Required, Optional, Nit order with exact file/line, violated contract, why wrong, smallest remediation, and missing verification."
  ],
